-01-05","date":"2026-01-08","session_order":"2","node_type":"section","node_name":"Myofascial release","node_order":"5","item_type":"exercise","title":"Brettzel 2.0 sa otklonom u stranu - FUL PROGRESIJA","description":"Tokom vežbe obavezno je nomalno disanje. Povećavanjem amplitude može doći do poremećaja disanja i tonusa. To je znak da treba stati, vratiti se malo unazad, udahnuti i tokom kontrolisanog i sporog izdisanja povećati amplitudu do sledeće izazovne pozicije. Kada više nema povećavanja, zadržati tu poziciju 20s. Voditi računa da tokom cele vežbe bude normalno disanje. Ruka koja je oslonac sve vreme opružena. Suprotno rame postaviti ka napred u liniji sa ramenom ruke koja je oslonac.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1TIGSvRbyUpgAgMCzcN9sfbGObqgHkddB","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18oye3Pr0y0YByMWiG0YI6ZafwiZSR_A0/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"30+30S","load":null,"item_order":"2","exercise_order":"2","source_row_ref":"1914","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Strenght Arms&Core","section_name":"Myofascial release","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#f9cb9c","section_color":"#a4c2f4","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"5","section_order":"5","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"473","exercise_expected_name":"Brettzel 2.0 sa otklonom u stranu - FUL PROGRESIJA"},{"plan_source_ref":"nikola-petkovic-107-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-01-05","date":"2026-01-08","session_order":"2","node_type":"section","node_name":"Strenght Arms&Core","node_order":"4","item_type":"exercise","title":"KNEE extensions","description":"3S LOW