i donji deo trupa i započeti za opružanjem gorenjih delova trupa. Disanje normalno održavati bez prekida","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=13vmxm8FeBSfSa79nC2Zl4Qfk6Df7_vJq","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zKZxQchps2Se2iFhoJ7_zPZFqNmBTbiO/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"4","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2009","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Morning activation","section_name":"stability1","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#f9cb9c","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c9jBrmpSHHKcYbsRsIYs_gDM6XkYN7UO/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"2","section_order":"2","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"459","exercise_expected_name":"Opružanje trupa iz ležanja na leđima sa asistencijom ruku"},{"plan_source_ref":"nikola-petkovic-107-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-20","date":"2026-07-23","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"stability2","node_order":"3","item_type":"exercise","title":"Klečeće zaključavanje kuka - ruke iza glave sa postavljanjem noge na steper sa zadrškom","description":"Snažno nogu podići bez dodirivanja podloge stopalom i sa zadrškom 1-2s preći na niski steper. Istovremeno podignuti eksplozivno stranu tela strane stajne noge prema plafonu. Pokušati da se trup ne pomeri u stranu (Može da se radi blizu zida sa ciljem da se ne dotakne zid).","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1FtihWxOMfvZtrltdvfacWV2097LZmGbA","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14lOHHuWs1sBZ79-blCFNLySw4EBUJsg7/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"4+4","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_or