e na prste, biti što je moguće viši. Koleno druge noge podići visoko i potisnuti akvareću. Skočni čvrst, nožene prste aktivriati - zariti u podlogu","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1lABzZb1mKio3pw7xbGSdE2hTtfLWt21G","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14SxE3BCNrl9JeYzgke_9PD7pWAN4W9ys/view?usp=drive_link","sets":"1","reps":"6+6","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2108","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Morning activation","section_name":"activation","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#f4cccc","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c9jBrmpSHHKcYbsRsIYs_gDM6XkYN7UO/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"4","section_order":"4","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"1028","exercise_expected_name":"Opružanje kolena zatezanjem gume sa podizanjem na prste + potisak akvareće"},{"plan_source_ref":"nikola-petkovic-107-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-20","date":"2026-07-26","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"mobility/stability","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Zasuci trupom prebacivanjem pogrčenih nogu","description":"Truditi se da lopatice budu na podlozi tokom pokreta. Naizmenično rotirati ruke suprotno od zasuka","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=14dej1jz3sSqH8kyOSNjqBiI0NvFWcrxS","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UlSkfPN5G-AVOXQPYG4GJul4a88fxCRR/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"5+5","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2090","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Morning activation","section_name":"mobility/stability","domain_color":null,"